## Professional Services

The open-source license does not include guaranteed support, maintenance,
consulting, implementation, or customization services.

Professional services may be provided according to each project's needs,
including:

- installation and onboarding;
- project-specific governance;
- custom mandates, policies, guardrails, and templates;
- integrations with AI agents, IDEs, CI/CD pipelines, and internal tools;
- private plugins and adapters;
- architecture and governance reviews;
- training and technical guidance;
- maintenance and support arrangements.

For customization, integration, consulting, or support, please contact the
author. Scope, delivery format, availability, and commercial terms will be
defined according to the specific need.

